<title>FINLAND: Konecranes shares rise on good demand.</title>
<headline>Konecranes shares rise on good demand.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish cranes maker KCI Konecranes International rose on Wednesday on solid demand, brokers said.</p>
<p>At 1230/0930 GMT, Konecranes traded at 220.00 markka, up 9.00 markka or 4.27 percent. Turnover in the share was a moderately lively 4.3 million markka.</p>
<p>The share was not seen rising much further, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe it will be stable at these levels today,&quot; one said.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 - 9 - 680 50 248</p>
